        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$farce_intro",
        "key": "$farce_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, is he alright?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No need to worry, he'll be back in a minute.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay... is he like... a person? I've never heard of anyone like him before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No idea, the High Priest only told me he's lived here for a very long time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright then. What else can we say...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew, he's really something...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_summer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial, your head is bleeding. Are you okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's fine, just a scratch. Tomimi, bring me my medical bag here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? Where did Tomimi go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here's your bag. And Tomimi, I think I saw her running off somewhere right before we won the fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks. She didn't get scared, did she? Anyway, let's patch ourselves up first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "You go check if anyone's injured, and bring them to me if they are. I'll take care of them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2013_cerber_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leave it to me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_summer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, no problem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh, what a pain. Fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd_summer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Quit yer belly-achin'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor... hmm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Big Ugly...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, Zumama. We had to take it apart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "I checked your engine, I think it's working fine. You can have it back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh yeah? That's great!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You really won't stay, Gavial?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, just like you, I've found my calling.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "To be a doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is doctoring fun?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Is building machines fun?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#5",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Same here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#5",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But you still have to be the Great Chief.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Any way you slice it, you beat the Big, Ugly Thing. You won, Gavial.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, everyone's here again. They're looking to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch. Doctor, what do we do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Your call.;......;All hail Great Chief Gavial!",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not giving me anything here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, I know you're awake! I'm a doctor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch. Doctor, I really want to punch you right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial, are you hurt?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? I'm fine. Where did you run off to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Oh, that... I had to go pee!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay... Hm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's wrong, Gavial? Why are you looking at me like that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm... Haha, I've got it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone, listen up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "I beat the Big Ugly, so I'm going to be the Great Chief.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "And so, my message to you is\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Your fists are everything!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh? Gavial, are you staying here to be the Great Chief?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "But!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have something very important I must do, so I have to leave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Worry not, though! When I'm gone, Tomimi will give orders on my behalf!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just treat Tomimi as you would treat me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh, w-w-what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that really gonna fly? Don't these people worship strength over everything?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial is the Great Chief after all. She defeated everyone, so her word is law.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha. Zumama, machines are pretty cool, but I think I'll stick with my fists after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. Don't forget, I still don't recognize you. I'll build an even greater machine and challenge you again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure, I'll be waiting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, right. Before that, you need to come with me for a bit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You need to come with me to Rhodes Island to get an Oripathy checkup.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Can I refuse? I still have to work on the Big Ugly...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't have a choice this time. Besides, until Tomimi takes over, I'm still the Great Chief. I'll bring you back even if I have to kidnap you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Gavial, are you going to leave after all?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yep, I'll probably be leaving right as soon as we get the engine back in the aircraft.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I won't let you leave!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
